[E0413] Error: `tail` is passed together with a `&var` reference to it
    ╭─[ err/53_match_bindings/main.wip:37:42 ]
    │
 37 │         .Cons(tail, ..) => clear(&var l, &tail)
    │                                  ───┬──  ──┬──
    │                                     ╰─────────── a `&var` reference
    │                                            │
    │                                            ╰──── a `&` reference
